      "source": "<strong>Standardization</strong>: Provides a consistent way to handle usage across different AI models\n<strong>Flexibility</strong>: Supports model-specific usage data through the native usage feature\n<strong>Simplification</strong>: Reduces boilerplate code with the default implementation\n<strong>Extensibility</strong>: Easy to extend for specific model requirements while maintaining compatibility",
      "translation": "<strong>标准化</strong>：提供一种在不同 AI 模型之间处理用量的一致方式\n<strong>灵活性</strong>：通过原生用量功能支持特定模型的用量数据\n<strong>简化性</strong>：通过默认实现减少样板代码\n<strong>可扩展性</strong>：在保持兼容性的同时，易于扩展以满足特定模型的需求",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring AI has enhanced its Model Usage handling by introducing <code>getNativeUsage()</code> method in the Usage interface and providing a <code>DefaultUsage</code> implementation.\nThis change simplifies how different AI models can track and report their usage metrics while maintaining consistency across the framework.",
      "translation": "Spring AI 通过在 Usage 接口中引入 <code>getNativeUsage()</code> 方法并提供 <code>DefaultUsage</code> 实现，增强了其对模型使用情况（Model Usage）的处理。\n这一变化简化了不同 AI 模型跟踪和报告其使用指标的方式，同时保持了框架的一致性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If you are using the <code>ChatClient</code>, you can access the usage information using the <code>ChatResponse</code> object:",
      "translation": "如果您正在使用 <code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">ChatClient</code>，您可以通过 <code style=\"color: #d73a49;\">ChatResponse</code> 对象获取使用信息：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>Usage</code> interface now includes a new method:",
      "translation": "<code >Usage</code> 接口现在包含一个新方法：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For providers that support prompt caching, the <code>Usage</code> interface provides unified access to cache metrics without requiring provider-specific casting:",
      "translation": "对于支持提示词缓存（prompt caching）的提供商，<code style=\"color: #d63384;\">Usage</code> 接口提供了统一的缓存指标访问方式，无需进行特定提供商的类型转换：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "These methods return <code>null</code> for providers that do not support prompt caching.",
      "translation": "这些方法对于不支持提示词缓存（prompt caching）的提供商将返回 <code >null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This method allows access to the model-specific native usage data, enabling more detailed usage tracking when needed.",
      "translation": "此方法允许访问特定于模型的原生使用数据，以便在需要时进行更详细的使用情况跟踪。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Here’s a complete example showing how to track usage with OpenAI’s ChatModel:",
      "translation": "以下是一个展示如何使用 OpenAI 的 ChatModel 跟踪用量的完整示例：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following table shows prompt cache metrics availability by provider:",
      "translation": "下表显示了各供应商提供的提示词缓存（prompt cache）指标可用性：",
      "count": 1
    },
